  &lt;img alt="4개의 PCB를 나열한 모습" src="https://game.donga.com/media/__sized__/images/2026/5/11/6317b60f113a4b63-thumbnail-1920x1080-70.jpg"/&gt;
  &lt;figcaption&gt;
   4개의 PCB를 나열한 모습
  &lt;/figcaption&gt;
 &lt;/figure&gt;
